# Netlify redirect rules: every old domain -> julianastanley.com, keeping the
# path, as permanent (301) redirects. This folder is its own tiny Netlify
# "site": drag-and-drop it at https://app.netlify.com/drop (or deploy it any
# other way), then attach julistanley.com, julianstanley.com, and their www
# subdomains to that Netlify site as custom domains.
https://julistanley.com/*      https://julianastanley.com/:splat  301!
https://www.julistanley.com/*  https://julianastanley.com/:splat  301!
https://julianstanley.com/*    https://julianastanley.com/:splat  301!
https://www.julianstanley.com/* https://julianastanley.com/:splat 301!
/*                             https://julianastanley.com/:splat  301!
